   "reproduction": {
    "command": "bun $TMPDIR/adj/p.ts  (calls closedIssues on \"Do X.\\n\\u00a0Closes #894\\u00a0\", \"Do X.\\nCloses\\u00a0#894\" and \"Do X.\\n\\u2003Closes #894\")",
    "output": "nbsp: []\nnbsp-mid: []\nemsp: []"
   },
   "evidence": "The regex at src/db/store.ts:343 uses `[ \\t]` for all optional and required whitespace, so it accepts only ASCII spaces and tabs. The issue says \"optional surrounding whitespace\" without limiting it to ASCII. This fails safe (no false link), and Unicode padding on a typed directive is uncommon, so the severity is minor."
